    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Analyze the customer lead using ONLY the information provided in the form.\n\nDo not make assumptions about the customer's budget, company, email, or buying intent.\n\nDetermine:\n\n1. Lead Qualification:\n- Qualified: The customer has a clear business/project requirement and enough information to understand their need.\n- Not Qualified: The request is irrelevant, clearly invalid, or contains insufficient information.\n- Needs More Information: The customer may be a potential lead, but important details are missing.\n\n2. Priority:\n- High: Clear requirement and strong potential business need.\n- Medium: Relevant requirement but some important information is missing.\n- Low: Very unclear, irrelevant, or insufficient information.\n\n3. Lead Score:\nGive a score from 0 to 100 based only on:\n- Clarity of requirement\n- Relevance of the request\n- Completeness of information\n- Estimated budget, if provided\n\n4. Main Requirement:\nClearly summarize what the customer is asking for.\n\n5. Reason:\nBriefly explain why you assigned this qualification, priority, and score.\n\nCustomer information:\nName: {{ $json.Name }}\nEmail: {{ $json.Email }}\nCompany: {{ $json.Company }}\nProject Requirement: {{ $json[\"What do you need help with?\"] }}\nEstimated Budget: {{ $json[\"Estimated Budget\"] }}\n\nReturn the result in exactly this format:\n\nLead Qualification:\nPriority:\nLead Score:\nMain Requirement:\nReason:",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        -608,
        -160
      ],
